{"id":"fb7afd006e0b80e7","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dependent-predicate-compat.md","title":"Compatibility alias","display":"df-dependent-predicate — Compatibility alias","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-dependent-predicate-compat","aliases":["16-df-dependent-predicate-compat"],"display":"df-dependent-predicate — Compatibility alias","depends_on":["[[16-df-dependent-predicate]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dependent-predicate-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dependent-predicate-compat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dependent-predicate — Compatibility alias"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"77011268b2b82ae6\" href=\"?note=77011268b2b82ae6\" title=\"16-df-dependent-predicate\">16-df-dependent-predicate</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\chi,q,I,X\">\\(p,\\chi,q,I,X\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"77011268b2b82ae6\" href=\"?note=77011268b2b82ae6\" title=\"16-df-dependent-predicate\">16-df-dependent-predicate</a> 的同底理解结构及型属条件；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\">\\(\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})\\)</span> 采用该页定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DepPred}^{df}_{\\chi,q}\">\\(\\mathrm{DepPred}^{df}_{\\chi,q}\\)</span> 是本页定义的历史拼写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DepPred}^{df}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DepPred}^{df}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>历史入口同步为共同基底 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 与扩展语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{X\\}\">\\(\\{X\\}\\)</span> 的接口；不再把类型对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span> 当作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 的基对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-dependent-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"77011268b2b82ae6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-dependent-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"77011268b2b82ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p,\\chi,q,I,X$ 满足 [[16-df-dependent-predicate]] 的同底理解结构及型属条件；$\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})$ 采用该页定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p,\\chi,q,I,X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)=\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D_{\\{X\\}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DepPred}^{df}_{\\chi,q}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DepPred}^{df}_{\\chi,q}(I,X)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{DepPred}_{\\chi,q}(I,X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\{X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false}],"bytes":900,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-175","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dependent-predicate-compat|df-dependent-predicate — Compatibility alias]]"}],"outgoing":["77011268b2b82ae6"]}